  description: '"Dark Magician" or "Dark Magician Girl" + 1 Spellcaster monster

    Once
    per turn, if a Spell/Trap Card or effect is activated (except during the Damage
    Step): You can draw 1 card, then if it was a Spell/Trap, you can Set it, and
    if it was a Trap or Quick-Play Spell, you can activate it this turn. If this
    card is destroyed: You can Special Summon both 1 "Dark Magician" and 1 "Dark
    Magician Girl" from your hand, Deck, and/or GY.'
